    text: "Affected stops:\r\nDecatur St & W Holden Pl (#34614) (eastbound)\r\nW Holden Pl & Federal Blvd (#34265) (eastbound)\r\nDecatur / Federal Station Gate E (#13703) (eastbound)\r\nAuraria Pkwy & 7th St (#25416) (eastbound)\r\nAuraria Pkwy & 9th St (#21356) (eastbound)\r\nMarket St & 14th St (#21374) (eastbound)\r\nMarket St & 16th Street (#17756) (eastbound)\r\n17th St & Lawrence St (#17717) (eastbound)\r\n17th St & Champa St [ X Stop ] (#17714) (eastbound)\r\n17th St & Welton St [ X Stop ] (#17711) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Sherman St (#12978) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Lafayette St (#35513) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Josephine St (#13019) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Steele St (#35368) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Colorado Blvd (#12864) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Steele St (#35321) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Josephine St (#12913) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Ogden St (#35514) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Grant St (#12891) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Broadway (#12850) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Cleveland Pl (#17698) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Tremont Pl [ X Stop ] (#17699) (westbound)\r\n15th St & California St [ X Stop ] (#17702) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Curtis St [ X Stop ] (#17705) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Larimer St (#17707) (westbound)\r\nBlake St & 14th St (#21375) (westbound)\r\nAuraria Pkwy & 7th St (#25415) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 15L get on/off buses at:\r\nDecatur / Federal Station Gate D (#33694)\r\nMarket St & 16th Street (#17756)\r\nBroadway & Cleveland Pl (#17730)\r\nColfax Ave & Eudora St (#12876)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 15L get on/off buses at:\r\nColfax Ave & Colorado Blvd (#12865)\r\nDecatur / Federal Station Gate C (#33693)"
